      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَطِيَّةٌ</span></b>  for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَطِيْئَةٌ</span>: see the latter, in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خطأ</span>.
[Freytag, evidently from his having found it incorrectly written for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَظِيَّةٌ</span>, has assigned to it the
meaning of “ amica, ” and “ amata. ”]

